{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:45 2026-10-29 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:17 2026-10-29 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:17 2026-10-29 HKT</p><p>佐敦發生火警。今日（29日）早上9時31分，彌敦道192至194號一間餐廳起火，冒出大量濃煙。街頭登時煙霧彌漫，途人紛紛走避。現場是彌敦道與柯士甸道交界，消防員接報到場灌救，其後將火救熄，沒有收到傷亡報告，火警原因有待調查。</p><img alt=\"餐廳起火冒煙。Threads「hllvv_hk_852」圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1992c12bbac98a1c472b370348379def/2026-10/870141295_17994737688111841_7490120198822558615_n.jpg\"/><p>受火警影響期間，運輸署宣布，柯士甸道（往紅磡方向）介乎彌敦道與覺士道之間的全線需要封閉；另外彌敦道（往梳士巴利道方向）近柯士甸道的慢線亦需封閉，交通繁忙。</p><img alt=\"餐廳起火，消防將火救熄。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/da01943bdb217fbc9148fceecab1594e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_10_36_14.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防員將火救息。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/e9d8bbadf08c6c0887a48313ace46756/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_10_36_16_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/0c83eb70f15e7b9449122f1f8d4b6715/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_10_36_16_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"人員調查火警原因。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/eb981e5f2803977f46977c22af05f9ba/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_10_36_16.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/3330f852b97129627a44b94843b10145/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_10_36_15_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"餐廳員工疏散。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d55aadf4d53d02a46a93d0610207e048/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_10_36_14_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9cc8f9201489c50888e4b5455e1d6555/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_10_36_17_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4327e85778a07b2ce677089695fff8e9/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_10_36_17_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方封路。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/74459f58dd5b3038cb7371d724e0aeff/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_10_36_17.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c7dd499160a270b0289e1ffaf604b4d2/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-29_at_10_36_15.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T03:01:25.537459+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":273,"images":11,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T02:45:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T05:58:40.841444+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T02:58:41.482764+00:00","content_hash":"35dc364f8c6ff03c33796dd4e7d9f5cb7e7c73fc32e2763ff907c34793a53750","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}